@host = http://localhost:5260

### Authorized (card ends in an odd digit)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248877",
  "expiry_month": 4,
  "expiry_year": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Declined (card ends in an even digit)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248112",
  "expiry_month": 1,
  "expiry_year": 2031,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 60000,
  "cvv": "456"
}

### Bank unavailable -> 502 (card ends in 0)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248870",
  "expiry_month": 4,
  "expiry_year": 2030,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Rejected -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "1234",
  "expiry_month": 13,
  "expiry_year": 2020,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "amount": 0,
  "cvv": "1"
}

### Get a payment (paste an id from a POST response)
GET {{host}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
